# Build/cache artifacts — regenerated remotely, must not be uploaded
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist

# Not part of any deployed app.
# NEVER list a bun workspace dir here (apps/*, packages/*): a missing
# workspace changes bun.lock → `bun install --frozen-lockfile` fails on Vercel.
docs
.claude

# Local-only
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.local
